00:16:01,020 --> 00:16:03,337
The priest himself was
here the whole time?

254
00:16:03,420 --> 00:16:08,126
The reason I have come is to save my stand
from you while it's still incomplete.

255
00:16:24,440 --> 00:16:26,360
It's complete.

256
00:16:26,760 --> 00:16:28,180
What now?

257
00:16:28,660 --> 00:16:32,100
Why am I lifting towards the sky?

258
00:16:32,540 --> 00:16:35,160
My body is the gravitational center.

259
00:16:35,860 --> 00:16:39,507
From where my feet are grounded,
gravity is pulled in reverse.

260
00:16:40,120 --> 00:16:43,340
And the closer you get, the
stronger the pull becomes.

261
00:16:43,760 --> 00:16:47,177
All I have to do now is wait
for my stand to become complete.

262
00:16:47,260 --> 00:16:49,800
As it is, my ability is still too weak.

263
00:16:50,060 --> 00:16:51,880
It must finish its evolution.

264
00:16:53,360 --> 00:16:55,831
Anastasia, pull Jolene down with her rope!

265
00:16:56,520 --> 00:16:57,840
I'm already trying!

266
00:17:00,380 --> 00:17:01,897
Listen closely, my stand.

267
00:17:01,980 --> 00:17:05,137
In order to turn them
inside out you must only hit

268
00:17:05,220 --> 00:17:08,557
them one time I'll say it
again only hit them one

269
00:17:08,640 --> 00:17:11,657
time don't waste time
targeting places like her

270
00:17:11,740 --> 00:17:17,300
arms or legs only deal one
punch without exception.

271
00:17:30,540 --> 00:17:32,900
All right, let's head back.

272
00:17:33,240 --> 00:17:35,887
We'll continue waiting
in the visitor center.

273
00:17:47,300 --> 00:17:49,037
What the hell?!

274
00:17:49,120 --> 00:17:51,000
This battle is over.

275
00:17:51,700 --> 00:17:56,277
Jolene can no longer feel any pain or have
the ability to use cognitive functions.

276
00:17:56,360 --> 00:17:58,660
Her heart has been turned inside out.

277
00:17:58,920 --> 00:18:02,685
The blood meant for her brain
should also be flowing in reverse.

278
00:18:02,940 --> 00:18:04,528
Keep on pulling, Anastasia!

279
00:18:04,920 --> 00:18:05,900
Hey, hurry up!

280
00:18:06,100 --> 00:18:08,100
Pull Jolene's body back down here!

281
00:18:11,600 --> 00:18:13,482
Jolene's thread's pulling apart!

282
00:18:23,800 --> 00:18:24,840
No way!

283
00:18:26,540 --> 00:18:27,370
No!

284
00:18:27,560 --> 00:18:28,540
It can't be!

285
00:18:34,940 --> 00:18:35,770
Jolene!

286
00:18:41,360 --> 00:18:43,040
It will need a name.

287
00:18:43,420 --> 00:18:45,520
I'll call this new ability Seamoon.

288
00:18:47,360 --> 00:18:48,190
Invincibility.

289
00:18:50,320 --> 00:18:54,496
Is that the power I've obtained even
before the coming of the new moon?

290
00:18:56,380 --> 00:19:01,580
However, I must keep on telling myself it
is not power which I desire. But rather,

291
00:19:01,780 --> 00:19:03,997
what I truly long for is
the ultimate happiness

292
00:19:04,080 --> 00:19:07,139
that every human being has
the potential to achieve.

293
00:19:07,380 --> 00:19:11,077
And Jolene Kujo was merely a
sacrificial pawn towards that end.

294
00:19:11,160 --> 00:19:14,697
The same goes for Weather
and the other prisoners who

295
00:19:14,780 --> 00:19:18,368
valiantly gave their lives to
further my righteous objective.

296
00:19:18,460 --> 00:19:20,660
Their sacrifice was necessary.

297
00:19:21,180 --> 00:19:22,010
No!

298
00:19:22,240 --> 00:19:23,460
There's just no way!

299
00:19:23,680 --> 00:19:25,300
What do we do now?

300
00:19:26,200 --> 00:19:27,030
Jolene!

301
00:19:27,340 --> 00:19:29,160
I can't believe that!

302
00:19:30,940 --> 00:19:32,660
Just isn't possible!

303
00:19:50,140 --> 00:19:50,970
What?

304
00:19:51,053 --> 00:19:52,100
What's that sound?

305
00:19:54,300 --> 00:19:55,380
My phone!

306
00:19:55,760 --> 00:19:56,800
But how?

307
00:19:57,220 --> 00:19:59,000
It wasn't working before.

308
00:20:00,620 --> 00:20:02,337
I got a text message.

309
00:20:02,420 --> 00:20:04,640
But who was it from?

310
00:20:06,620 --> 00:20:08,417
My calls aren't going through.

311
00:20:08,500 --> 00:20:12,800
The gravitational anomaly seems to
have sent a satellite out of orbit.

312
00:20:14,040 --> 00:20:15,520
Are you Emporio?

313
00:20:16,180 --> 00:20:18,400
I don't know exactly what's going on.

314
00:20:18,620 --> 00:20:21,973
But I can sense that my daughter
and the priest have met.

315
00:20:22,820 --> 00:20:23,650
Wait...

316
00:20:23,733 --> 00:20:25,117
could this text be from...

317
00:20:25,200 --> 00:20:27,077
could it be...

318
00:20:27,160 --> 00:20:29,360
the person who said this?

319
00:20:30,600 --> 00:20:34,160
Jolene is alive, but she's not safe.

320
00:20:35,300 --> 00:20:36,417
Protect Jolene.

321
00:20:36,500 --> 00:20:38,457
Just until I arrive!

322
00:20:38,540 --> 00:20:40,157
That's all I ask.

323
00:20:40,240 --> 00:20:43,117
She must have discovered
how to counter his gravity.

324
00:20:43,200 --> 00:20:45,637
That's the only way she
could have survived.

325
00:20:45,720 --> 00:20:48,340
She's alive, but just barely.

326
00:20:49,840 --> 00:20:50,897
Jotaro Kujo.

327
00:20:50,980 --> 00:20:52,937
Yeah, it is Mr.

328
00:20:53,020 --> 00:20:55,200
Jotaro He must be close by

329
00:20:56,040 --> 00:20:56,870
I...

330
00:20:56,953 --> 00:20:57,940
I can't believe it

331
00:20:58,680 --> 00:21:00,445
Jolene's actually still alive.

332
00:21:01,960 --> 00:21:03,160
Then that means!

333
00:21:04,540 --> 00:21:05,540
Could it be?

334
00:21:06,920 --> 00:21:08,737
Anastasia you gotta find Jolene.

335
00:21:08,820 --> 00:21:11,120
I think that Jolene is still alive.

336
00:21:12,020 --> 00:21:12,877
For real!

337
00:21:12,960 --> 00:21:14,937
Yeah but that also means that!

338
00:21:15,020 --> 00:21:16,337
That pooch he'd lose.

339
00:21:16,420 --> 00:21:18,897
Since he has the same
ability to sense her!

340
00:21:18,980 --> 00:21:21,215
He's aware that she's still alive too.

341
00:21:21,840 --> 00:21:22,917
What's going on?

342
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:24,197
Jolene Kujo.

343
00:21:24,280 --> 00:21:26,927
Her heart should have
been turned inside out.

344
00:21:27,800 --> 00:21:29,217
My gravitational power!

345
00:21:29,300 --> 00:21:31,418
Should have destroyed it completely.

346
00:21:32,140 --> 00:21:34,258
How in the world is she still alive?

347
00:21:34,480 --> 00:21:35,421
What did she do?

348
00:21:35,840 --> 00:21:37,600
I have to put an end to this.

349
00:21:37,780 --> 00:21:42,251
The Joestar bloodline is something I
must overcome, no matter what it takes!

350
00:21:42,340 --> 00:21:43,600
Dive or drive!

351
00:21:52,040 --> 00:21:53,452
Which way are you going?

352
00:21:54,720 --> 00:21:55,800
Take a guess.

353
00:21:56,320 --> 00:22:00,880
In order to protect Jolene, I'm gonna
have to kill that fucking priest!

354
00:22:30,880 --> 00:22:35,560
My head is filled with hope.

355
00:22:36,800 --> 00:22:43,720
Of some place other than here.

356
00:22:46,660 --> 00:22:50,220
Although you think I smile.

357
00:22:51,920 --> 00:22:55,260
Inside and all the while.

358
00:22:57,100 --> 00:23:03,480
I'm wondering about my destiny.

359
00:23:06,000 --> 00:23:07,917
I'm thinking

360
00:23:08,000 --> 00:23:13,157
about all

361
00:23:13,240 --> 00:23:19,500
the things I'd like to do?

362
00:23:21,440 --> 00:23:24,437
In my life,

363
00:23:24,520 --> 00:23:29,360
I'm a dreamer,

364
00:23:29,640 --> 00:23:34,540
a distant dreamer,

365
00:23:34,940 --> 00:23:38,237
dreaming far

366
00:23:38,320 --> 00:23:44,580
away from today.

367
00:23:50,740 --> 00:23:52,140
Thank you.

368
00:24:19,500 --> 00:24:21,300
Thank you.
